  "rules": [
    "Fourth Class remains common-core and non-specialist.",
    "The three trimesters progress from institution to shipboard life to operational foundations.",
    "Each trimester contains five courses.",
    "Physical readiness is longitudinal and uses the shared habit/development systems.",
    "Personal hobbies remain separate from required physical-readiness coursework but may develop the same underlying character capabilities.",
